25
00:01:56,180 --> 00:02:00,980
Even if you're trading with your own account with a million dollars in it, you're still considered a retail account.

26
00:02:01,580 --> 00:02:06,280
You don't become an institutional account just because you have a lot of money in the account.

27
00:02:08,280 --> 00:02:18,080
An institutional trader can either be someone trading at a bank, at a fund, trading for hedging purposes.

28
00:02:18,380 --> 00:02:19,780
